; The STATE descriptile of panic-attack (A7 7.2, J14, J15; profile
; clauses/state.abnf, checked by `deed_lint.js --state`).
;
; (status …) is CLADE.a2ml's [status] section and its one [[status.history]]
; entry, translated field for field under standards
; 1-formats/deed/mappings/clade-to-repo-deed.adoc as updated by standards#1579:
; lifecycle goes to STATE.deed, not to the chora deed. The values are the
; source's, including its own note that the history entry is a backfilled
; default. The (status …) clause the chora deed carried before (phase active,
; with a description as its note) is replaced by this one.
;
; The repo's (maturity …) clause is still in panic-attack_chora.deed: its level,
; `stable`, is outside the closed set in vocabulary/maturity.adoc, and choosing
; the level is the owner's call.
;
; STATE.a2ml (state-v1-decision.adoc, option B) adds nothing here: it has no
; maturity field, its status string duplicates the CLADE phase, and the rest
; is journal, archived by reference in docs/history/A2ML-REMOVED.adoc.
(descriptile-deed
  :schema-version "1.0.0"
  :canonical-name "panic-attack"
  :of-chora #uuid"a39ad6b1-51e0-854d-aa9a-d9ee97ba519b"
  :affirmed "2026-11-14"
  :affirmed-by agent
  (status
    :phase active
    :since "2026-03-16"
    :present #t
    :aliases ()
    :merged-into ""
    :superseded-by ""
    :successors ()
    :ended ""
    (history
      (entry :phase active :since "2026-03-16" :note "backfilled default — correct if the true phase differs"))))
